    title_zh: "英国Palmer Energy与斯洛伐克InoBat签署泛欧电池储能供应合作协议",
    desc_en: "UK energy firm Palmer Energy Technology and Slovak battery maker InoBat signed a collaboration agreement around September 15 to supply battery energy storage systems across Europe, with Palmer taking the lead in the UK and Ireland and InoBat leading in continental Europe and North America; the deal includes arrangements for Palmer to supply InoBat with storage units through the rest of 2026. It comes as the UK government pursues a 27 GW battery storage target, underscoring growing British demand for grid-scale storage capacity to back its renewables buildout.",
    desc_zh: "英国能源企业Palmer Energy Technology与斯洛伐克电池制造商InoBat于9月15日前后签署合作协议,双方将在欧洲范围内供应电池储能系统:Palmer主导英国及爱尔兰市场,InoBat主导欧洲大陆及北美市场;协议还包括Palmer在2026年剩余时间内向InoBat供应储能设备的安排。此次合作正值英国政府力推27吉瓦电池储能目标之际,凸显英国为支撑可再生能源建设而对电网级储能容量日益增长的需求。",
