    title_zh: "罗马尼亚敲定家庭电池储能补贴细则,预算4亿列伊",
    desc_en: "Romania's Ministry of Environment, Waters and Forests finalized the rules for a national battery-storage subsidy scheme on September 15, after a public consultation that drew more than 200 submissions. Administered by the Administrația Fondului pentru Mediu, the RON 400 million (about $87.8 million) program will cover up to 75% of costs for prosumers with a grid-connected solar system who add battery storage, with grants capped at RON 15,000 including VAT. The final rules lowered the minimum eligible storage size from 12 kWh to 10 kWh and raised the maximum eligible cost standard to RON 1,500 per kWh, with applications ranked by score rather than processed first-come, first-served.",
    desc_zh: "罗马尼亚环境、水利与森林部于9月15日敲定了全国家庭电池储能补贴计划的最终细则,此前该计划历经公开征询,收到200多份意见反馈。该计划由罗马尼亚环境基金管理局(AFM)负责实施,预算为4亿列伊(约合8780万美元),面向已并网太阳能系统的产消者(prosumer),补贴最高可覆盖新增电池储能系统成本的75%,单户补贴上限为1.5万列伊(含增值税)。最终规则将最低申请储能容量由12千瓦时降至10千瓦时,并将每千瓦时最高认定成本上调至1500列伊,申请将按评分排序而非先到先得。",
    source_name: "Energy-Storage.News",
    source_url: "https://www.ess-news.com/2026/09/15/romania-finalizes-rules-for-national-battery-storage-subsidy-program/"
